<span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">You are auditing a single reasoning entry that an automated evaluator cited when rejecting a fitness coaching message. Your job is to determine whether this specific reasoning entry is valid.
You will receive: … coaching_message, system_state, cited dimension, cited evidence…</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">A reasoning entry is VALID ("yes") if and only if BOTH of the following hold:</span></span>
<span id="A5.I5" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A5.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I5.i1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1.</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I5.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The cited Dimension is genuinely violated by the coaching message.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I5.i2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2.</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I5.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The cited Evidence accurately reflects the violation — either as a
verbatim snippet from the coaching message OR as a logically sound
free-text explanation of why that dimension is violated. The evidence does
NOT need to quote the message verbatim; a paraphrased or approximate
description is acceptable as long as it accurately characterizes the
actual violation.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">A reasoning entry is INVALID ("no") if:</span></span>
<span id="A5.I6" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A5.I6.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I6.i1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I6.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I6.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I6.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The cited Dimension is NOT actually violated by the coaching message
(the violation does not exist or is fabricated), OR</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I6.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I6.i2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I6.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I6.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I6.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The cited Evidence does not accurately reflect the actual violation
(e.g., it quotes text not present in the message, describes behavior the
message does not exhibit, or identifies the wrong infraction).</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">IMPORTANT: You are evaluating only THIS ONE entry. Whether the message has other violations that were not cited is irrelevant, judge only whether this specific citation is accurate.</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">RUBRIC DIMENSIONS you may encounter: actionable, non_judgmental, no_gamification, safety_first, system_grounded.</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p2.pic1.p2.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">ANSWER: “yes” if this reasoning entry is valid, “no” if it is invalid.</span></span>
