<span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">The gap.</span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> The combination code detects the sentence-count violation deterministically (</span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">has_multiple_sentences</span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">). But unlike the subjective dimensions, whose cited evidence is checked by the </span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">p_reasoning_entry_valid</span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> predicate, the </span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">sentence_count</span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> branch only confirms that a violation </span><em id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.9" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">exists</em><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">; it never verifies that the cited evidence matches the message. Here the message genuinely violates </span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">sentence_count</span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> (two sentences split by a period), yet the evaluator’s evidence is fabricated (three statements joined by semicolons). The rule labels a right-verdict / wrong-evidence case as </span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Bug</span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.14" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, but the combination code accepts the entry and outputs </span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.15" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Fail</span><span id="A5.SS1.p4.pic1.p1.pic1.1.3.16" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Predicate-local adversarial examples</h4>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="424.18" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 424.18" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,424.18) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 2.77 L 0 421.41 C 0 422.94 1.24 424.18 2.77 424.18 L 474.61 424.18 C 476.14 424.18 477.38 422.94 477.38 421.41 L 477.38 2.77 C 477.38 1.24 476.14 0 474.61 0 L 2.77 0 C 1.24 0 0 1.24 0 2.77 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FAFAFA;" fill="#FAFAFA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 2.77 L 0.69 406.28 L 476.68 406.28 L 476.68 2.77 C 476.68 1.62 475.76 0.69 474.61 0.69 L 2.77 0.69 C 1.62 0.69 0.69 1.62 0.69 2.77 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 406.97 L 0.69 421.41 C 0.69 422.56 1.62 423.49 2.77 423.49 L 474.61 423.49 C 475.76 423.49 476.68 422.56 476.68 421.41 L 476.68 406.97 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.55 410.9)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.83em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="8.65" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="426.6"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.83em;">
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Task definition</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.55 120.51)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.49em;--ltx-fo-height:19.97em;--ltx-fo-depth:7.98em;font-size:10pt;" height="386.64" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 276.29)" width="491.08"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.49em;">
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are given a complete user-agent conversation transcript (alternating &lt;User&gt; and &lt;Agent&gt; turns, ending with the agent’s reply). Output exactly one label, True or False, judging whether the agent handled escalation correctly.</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Escalation is warranted if the user re-raises the same unresolved intent at least three times - verbatim, rephrased, or as renewed dissatisfaction that it still isn’t resolved (e.g. "that didn’t work", "you’re not helping"). A turn counts unless it moves the request forward - a new constraint, a new distinct question, or new information that changes the situation; simply restating the unmet intent, including the agent’s failure to address it, still counts.</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">A conversation is considered escalated when the agent’s final reply connects the user with a human agent; any other final reply (answering, declining, asking something back, etc.) is not an escalation.</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Assign the label by comparing what the agent actually did in its final reply against what was warranted:</span></span>
<span id="A5.I7" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A5.I7.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I7.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I7.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I7.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">True</span><span id="A5.I7.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: the agent acted correctly - an escalation was both warranted and performed, or an escalation was not warranted and was not performed by the agent.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I7.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I7.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I7.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I7.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">False</span><span id="A5.I7.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: the agent acted incorrectly - escalation is warranted but was not performed by the agent, or no escalation is needed but the agent performed one.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="1153.34" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 1153.34" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,1153.34) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 2.77 L 0 1150.57 C 0 1152.1 1.24 1153.34 2.77 1153.34 L 474.61 1153.34 C 476.14 1153.34 477.38 1152.1 477.38 1150.57 L 477.38 2.77 C 477.38 1.24 476.14 0 474.61 0 L 2.77 0 C 1.24 0 0 1.24 0 2.77 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FAFAFA;" fill="#FAFAFA" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 2.77 L 0.69 1133.01 L 476.68 1133.01 L 476.68 2.77 C 476.68 1.62 475.76 0.69 474.61 0.69 L 2.77 0.69 C 1.62 0.69 0.69 1.62 0.69 2.77 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#595959;" fill="#595959" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 1133.7 L 0.69 1150.57 C 0.69 1151.71 1.62 1152.64 2.77 1152.64 L 474.61 1152.64 C 475.76 1152.64 476.68 1151.71 476.68 1150.57 L 476.68 1133.7 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.55 1140.06)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.83em;--ltx-fo-height:0.63em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="426.6"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.83em;">
<span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Decomposition</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 11.55 10.16)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:35.49em;--ltx-fo-height:80.46em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="1113.39" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 1113.39)" width="491.08"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:35.49em;">
<span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" color="#000000" height="679.32" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 454.28 679.32" width="454.28"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,679.32) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#A6A6A6;" fill="#A6A6A6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 1.94 L 0 677.38 C 0 678.45 0.87 679.32 1.94 679.32 L 452.34 679.32 C 453.41 679.32 454.28 678.45 454.28 677.38 L 454.28 1.94 C 454.28 0.87 453.41 0 452.34 0 L 1.94 0 C 0.87 0 0 0.87 0 1.94 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.55 1.94 L 0.55 643.89 L 453.73 643.89 L 453.73 1.94 C 453.73 1.17 453.11 0.55 452.34 0.55 L 1.94 0.55 C 1.17 0.55 0.55 1.17 0.55 1.94 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#E8E8E8;" fill="#E8E8E8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.55 644.45 L 0.55 677.38 C 0.55 678.14 1.17 678.76 1.94 678.76 L 452.34 678.76 C 453.11 678.76 453.73 678.14 453.73 677.38 L 453.73 644.45 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.03 650.53)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:39.23em;--ltx-fo-height:1.9em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.17em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="26.44" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 24.29)" width="502.12"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:39.23em;">
<span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Predicate <span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">p_warranted</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.03 8.64)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.92em;--ltx-fo-height:49em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="627.17" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 627.17)" width="434.15"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.92em;">
<span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">You are given a complete user-agent conversation transcript (alternating User and Agent turns). Your task is ONLY to determine whether the user raised the same single unresolved intent at least three times.</span></span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">A user turn COUNTS toward the threshold if the user:</span></span>
<span id="A5.I8" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A5.I8.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I8.i1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I8.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I8.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I8.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Repeats the same request verbatim</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I8.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I8.i2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I8.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I8.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I8.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Rephrases the same unmet demand in different words</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I8.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I8.i3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I8.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I8.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I8.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Expresses renewed dissatisfaction that the issue remains unresolved</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I8.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I8.i4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I8.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I8.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I8.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Responds to the agent’s clarifying question by declining to elaborate and simply reiterating the original request — this is a repetition, not new information.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I8.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I8.i5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I8.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I8.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I8.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Reports that the agent’s suggested solution does not apply to them or has not worked - foreclosing one proposed path does not change what the user fundamentally needs; the underlying intent is unchanged and the turn counts</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I8.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I8.i6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I8.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I8.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I8.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Adds motivation, urgency, or personal context to an otherwise unchanged request</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">A user turn does NOT count if it:</span></span>
<span id="A5.I9" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A5.I9.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I9.i1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I9.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I9.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I9.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Introduces a new constraint or requirement that changes what specifically is being requested</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I9.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I9.i2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I9.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I9.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I9.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Asks a new, distinct question or shifts to a different topic or sub-topic</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I9.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I9.i3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I9.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I9.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I9.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Provides new information that materially changes the situation, meaning information that changes what the user fundamentally needs or what the underlying problem is</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS2.p2.pic1.p1.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Important counting rules:</span></span>
<span id="A5.I10" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A5.I10.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I10.i1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I10.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I10.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I10.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Count per distinct intent separately.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I10.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I10.i2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I10.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I10.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I10.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Whether the agent produced any response is NOT the criterion for ’resolved.’</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I10.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A5.I10.i3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">•</span></span> 
<span id="A5.I10.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I10.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I10.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Do not rely on the user’s own claim about how many times they’ve asked.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
